{"id": "60171", "title": "甜蜜的要你", "author": "轻笑语", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60171.htm", "intro": "甜蜜的要你\r\n进度：完结\r\n属性分类：现代／校园故事／未定／未定\r\n关键字：晴羽 　爱情 　 \r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n资料夹列表\r\n第一卷 狼骑竹马（男主登场）\r\n第二卷 抽丝剥茧\r\n第三卷 意乱情迷（剧情高潮）\r\n晴羽的甜蜜性福生活\r\n\r\n文章预览：\r\n☆、第一章 \r\n\r\n午後的阳光从树叶的缝隙中落下。撒在我身上。\r\n怀着树干。坐在草坪上。拿着小说。我悠长的叹了一口气。\r\n“真舒服啊，没有什麽人打扰，安安静静的看书。”闭上眼，温暖的阳光下。我昏昏欲睡。\r\n“啊，啊，不要……轻点，啊！！”\r\n耳边的呻吟声越来越大，还伴有波波的声音，“烦死了，看个书也不让人安宁”我愤愤的睁开眼，扭头，想看看是谁扰我清梦。\r\n氀身，我呆住了。", "base": "files/article/html/60/60171", "chapters": [{"title": "1-6", "file": "8822122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-11", "file": "8822125.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-17", "file": "8822129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-25", "file": "8822131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-31", "file": "8822133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-37", "file": "8822135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-43", "file": "8822138.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-50", "file": "8822140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-56", "file": "8822143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-61", "file": "8822144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "62-66", "file": "8822146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "67-74", "file": "8822149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "75-80", "file": "8822151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-83", "file": "8822152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "84-89", "file": "8822154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "90-94", "file": "8822156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结+番外", "file": "8822158.html", "available": false}]}